      {
        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "bef57742-5cd4-585d-82d9-644e4752a203",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Kingdom of Slavonia, Military Frontier, Slavonian Military Frontier, Croatia\n- Organizations: Habsburg Monarchy, Austrian Empire, Austro-Hungarian Empire, Ottoman Empire, Jesuits\n- People: Tomo Zdelarić, Serbs of Croatia\n- Concepts: Habsburg military service, identity\n\nFacts:\n- Tomo Zdelarić, who lived circa 1531 to 8 April 1572, was the earliest Jesuit from the Habsburg Kingdom of Slavonia.\n- The Kingdom of Slavonia was a province of the Habsburg Monarchy and later the Austrian Empire from 1699 to 1868.\n- The southern parts of the Kingdom of Slavonia were part of the Slavonian Military Frontier, which was a section of the Military Frontier.\n- The Military Frontier was a province along the southern borderland of the Habsburg Monarchy and later of the Austrian Empire and Austro-Hungarian Empire.\n- For Serbs of Croatia, Habsburg military service was an important part of their identity because Serbs defended the Military Frontier from the Ottoman Empire.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "21186d6d-eccb-595d-a577-1eb6c3c6bb10",
        "text": "Page: Kingdom of Slavonia. Sentence: The Kingdom of Slavonia (Croatian: \"Kraljevina Slavonija\" ; German: \"Königreich Slawonien\" ; Latin: \"Regnum Sclavoniae\" ; Hungarian: \"Szlavón Királyság\" ) was a province of the Habsburg Monarchy and the Austrian Empire that existed from 1699 to 1868.\nPage: Kingdom of Slavonia. Sentence: The southern parts of these regions were part of the Slavonian Military Frontier, which was a section of the Military Frontier.\nPage: Military Frontier. Sentence: The Military Frontier was a province straddling the southern borderland of the Habsburg Monarchy and later the Austrian and Austro-Hungarian Empire.\nPage: Tomo Zdelarić. Sentence: Tomo Zdelarić () (c. 1531 – 8 April 1572} was the earliest Jesuit from Habsburg Kingdom of Slavonia.\nPage: Serbs of Croatia. Sentence: An important part of their identity is the Habsburg military service, where Serbs defended the Military Frontier from the Ottoman Empire.",
